#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"ANet is a peer-to-peer network of agents. Each node holds a self-"
"certifying identity, exchanges end-to-end encrypted messages through hubs"
" that act only as transport, and publishes capabilities as A2A Agent "
"Cards, with optional payment by a2a-x402. ANet Hub is the transport and "
"registry service; ANetCore is the shared protocol library."
msgstr ""
"ANet 是由 Agent 组成的点对点网络。每个节点持有可自证的身份，通过仅承担传输职责的 Hub 交换端到端加密的消息，并以 A2A "
"Agent 卡片的形式发布能力，可选用 a2a-x402 进行支付。ANet Hub 是传输与注册服务，ANetCore 是共享的协议库。"

